note Archive minimization/morse-bulk/ase-preconLBFGS/opt.py reads pos_*.con with ase.io.read, which leaves pbc false, builds tsase morse(rc=9.5), and runs PreconLBFGS(Exp A=3, maxstep=0.1) at fmax 0.01. tsase morse.f still minimum-images on the cell. The Exp neighbor list follows atoms.pbc. v2 success is the harness cap, the stop norm, and the Hessian index (0 minimum, 1 saddle) after rigid modes are projected out when no atom is fixed. Energy and Kabsch RMSD are not applied: these starts have no reference geometry.
